        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "We had a fantastic experience with Dr. Poisson and her entire team. From the moment we walked in, we felt welcomed and at ease. The office is bright, clean, and very child-friendly.\n\nDr. Élyane Poisson took the time to explain every step of the process in a way both my son and I could understand. The team was  patient, gentle, and genuinely caring.\n\nThe treatment plan was clear, communication was always prompt and professional, and we never felt rushed or overlooked.\n\nHighly recommend Dr. Poisson for her professonalism and no nonsense child centres approach.",
